c main(){\n\tfor _, s := range []string{\"NaN\",\"-Inf\",\"+Inf\",\"inf\",\"-1e308\",\"0x1p1000\",\"1_0\",\".5\",\"-0.5\"} {\n\t\tf, err := strconv.ParseFloat(s, 64)\n\t\tfmt.Printf(\"ParseFloat(%q) = %v, err=%v\\n\", s, f, err)\n\t}\n\tfor _, s := range []string{\"-999999999\",\"+5\",\"0x10\"} {\n\t\tn, err := strconv.Atoi(s)\n\t\tfmt.Printf(\"Atoi(%q) = %v, err=%v\\n\", s, n, err)\n\t}\n\tvar acc float64\n\tacc += 3.0\n\tacc += -1e308\n\tacc += -1e308\n\tfmt.Println(\"accumulated:\", acc)\n\tvar nan float64\n\tnan = 3.0\n\tf,_ := strconv.ParseFloat(\"NaN\",64)\n\tnan += f\n\tfmt.Printf(\"with NaN: %v; nan > 100 = %v; nan < 100 = %v\\n\", nan, nan > 100, nan < 100)\n}\nEOF\ngo run m.go","description":"Confirm ParseFloat accepts NaN/Inf"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01WAUhbwPnmt5T7yMYo7FJyb","tool_input":{"command":"set -e\nT=$(mktemp -d)\ncp -r /home/drspeedracer/Workspace/agentic-flywheel-fw-d20/. \"$T/\" 2>/dev/null || true\ncd \"$T\"\ngit checkout -- tools/fleet/cost.go\ncd \"$T\" && go test ./tools/fleet/ -run 'ReadSpend' 2>&1 | tail -30\necho \"TMP=$T\"","description":"Run new tests against unfixed cost.go in a temp copy"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01Jnfmx2aQBEicnb9eAVeesK","tool_input":{"command":"git log --oneline -S'{\"ts\":\"2026-08-20T22:28:25Z\",\"event\":\"bead.gate_green\"' -- .flywheel/agent-log.jsonl | head; echo \"=== count occurrences per commit ===\"; for c in $(git log --format=%h -- .flywheel/agent-log.jsonl | head -12); do n=$(git show $c:.flywheel/agent-log.jsonl 2>/dev/null | grep -c 'bead.gate_green.*fw-dov' || true); echo \"$c $n\"; done","description":"Trace duplicate gate_green lines through history"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01TqsUMfE4LwAFRF6S6irxLW","tool_input":{"command":"mkdir -p /tmp/fwd20chk && cp -r /home/drspeedracer/Workspace/agentic-flywheel-fw-d20/tools /tmp/fwd20chk/ && cp /home/drspeedracer/Workspace/agentic-flywheel-fw-d20/go.mod /tmp/fwd20chk/ 2>/dev/null; ls /tmp/fwd20chk","description":"Copy tools tree to temp for baseline test"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01YJxV5FaHSjcmkF5WphHcrm","tool_input":{"command":"cd /tmp/pfchk && rm -f m.go && go mod init pfchk >/dev/null 2>&1; go run main.go","description":"Run ParseFloat/Atoi probe"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01149Urg2qtFrhXxSnJv6qQz","tool_input":{"command":"rm -rf /tmp/fleetchk && mkdir -p /tmp/fleetchk && cp -r /home/drspeedracer/Workspace/agentic-flywheel-fw-d20/tools /tmp/fleetchk/tools && cp /home/drspeedracer/Workspace/agentic-flywheel-fw-d20/go.mod /tmp/fleetchk/ && cp /home/drspeedracer/Workspace/agentic-flywheel-fw-d20/go.sum /tmp/fleetchk/ 2>/dev/null; ls /tmp/fleetchk","description":"Copy fleet package to a scratch dir"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_019wJ7ktb9cvrGv83YTkbm6N","tool_input":{"command":"go run /tmp/pfchk/main.go","description":"Run ParseFloat probe"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_016z5XrZx56cFuLDQDdC48Np","tool_input":{"command":"go run ./tools/fleet cost 2>&1 | head -20","description":"Run fleet cost with the fix"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01Ucw3G3Y91m4M5Y6soSWKP3","tool_input":{"command":"go run ./tools/fleet cost","description":"Run fleet cost with the fix"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_014S8JvHMowrWY7PGixXDLdG","tool_input":{"command":"sed -n 43p .flywheel/agent-log.jsonl | cmp - <(sed -n 52p .flywheel/agent-log.jsonl) && echo \"IDENTICAL\"","description":"Check whether ledger lines 43 and 52 are byte-identical"}}],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":3,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":3,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":1,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":3,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{"general-purpose":3}},"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"Done. PR is open and the tree is clean.\n\n## Report\n\n**Bead** `fw-d20` — one PR counted as two greens when it logged both `pr_opened` and `gate_green`. Ran solo (`run-context.json`: `builders_in_this_repo: 1`), so no blackbird registration or reservation.\n\n**What I did.** Deduplicate greens in `ReadSpend` on `(bead, pr)` — not on `bead`, which would trade the overcount for an undercount when a bead legitimately opens two PRs. Deduplication touches only the denominator; each event keeps its own `usd`/`tokens`, and there's a test pinning that.\n\n**Gate** green — gofmt, vet, vet-conformance, build, full suite, plus lefthook on all three commits. No bypass. I reverted `cost.go` and re-ran to confirm the new tests actually bite: the unfixed reader reports `$2.25` per green PR where `$4.50` is correct.\n\n**Review** (`/flywheel-review`, three lenses, 9 findings, all in `.flywheel/review.jsonl` including the rejections). Four accepted and fixed before opening the PR — the two worth naming:\n\n- The comment claimed the gate emits `bead.gate_green`. **Nothing in this repo emits it** — every `guard.sh log` call site writes `claimed`/`pr_opened`/`abandoned`/`gate.skipped`. It's convention, not a guarantee, and the comment now says so.\n- The comment called the per-event fallback the conservative direction. It isn't — a larger denominator makes the fleet look *cheaper* per PR. Corrected.\n\n**PR** https://github.com/jamesponwith/agentic-flywheel/pull/62 (`w:2`, branched from `main`, not stacked). Not merged — yours.\n\n**Left out, filed rather than bundled:**\n- `fw-6gc` — the live ledger holds byte-identical duplicate lines (`fw-dov`). `guard.sh restore-log` states \"two identical lines ARE the same event\" and enforces it with `sort -u`; `ReadSpend` is the one reader that doesn't, and it inflates `Builders` too. Different cause, different key, separately revertible.\n- `fw-55c` — `ParseFloat` accepts `NaN`/`Inf` for `usd=`, which makes `fleet cost -json` unrenderable and poisons the fleet total while still reporting `ok=true`. Pre-existing.\n\nTwo corrections to my own earlier claims, both recorded on the bead: only 3 of the 4 original tests failed against the unfixed reader — `DoesNotDeduplicateGreensWithoutAPR` asserts the fix's *scope*, not the fix — and that test is now commented to say so. I also couldn't run `fleet cost` against the live ledger to show the before/after; the command needed approval I didn't have, so the tests are the only verification of the live-data effect.\n\n`fw-d20` stays open until the PR merges. I don't have a token/dollar figure for this run — nothing in the session reported one.","ttft_ms":2044,"ttft_stream_ms":1172,"time_to_request_ms":224,"type":"result","duration_ms":874724,"uuid":"968778d8-fe82-43fc-98e2-c9dff5c4ed41"}
